{"id":"6695:317440","name":"图表颜色使用规则 / 完善版","texts":[{"id":"6695:317441","text":"1种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317442","text":"4种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317443","text":"5种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317444","text":"6种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317445","text":"7种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317446","text":"2种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317447","text":"3种颜色","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317504","text":"设计图表时，根据以下配色方案使用","visible":false},{"id":"6695:317508","text":"图表颜色 / Series Palettes","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317509","text":"保留原目标1—7色候选顺序；具体业务语义与既有系列映射优先。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317510","text":"2026.10.21 · 项目明文 / 样本实测 / 补充建议分别标记","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317512","text":"1种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317516","text":"S1 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317518","text":"2种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317522","text":"S1 · #33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317525","text":"S2 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317527","text":"3种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317531","text":"S1 · #33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317534","text":"S2 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317537","text":"S3 · #3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317539","text":"4种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317543","text":"S1 · #33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317546","text":"S2 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317549","text":"S3 · #3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317552","text":"S4 · #8EAAD4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317554","text":"5种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317558","text":"S1 · #33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317561","text":"S2 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317564","text":"S3 · #3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317567","text":"S4 · #56B8FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317570","text":"S5 · #8EAAD4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317572","text":"6种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317576","text":"S1 · #33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317579","text":"S2 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317582","text":"S3 · #3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317585","text":"S4 · #56B8FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317588","text":"S5 · #949CF8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317591","text":"S6 · #8EAAD4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317593","text":"7种颜色 / 原目标候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317597","text":"S1 · #33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317600","text":"S2 · #66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317603","text":"S3 · #3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317606","text":"S4 · #56B8FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317609","text":"S5 · #2DCAE0","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317612","text":"S6 · #949CF8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317615","text":"S7 · #8EAAD4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317617","text":"使用范围与映射","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317619","text":"原目标候选色序","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317620","text":"上方1至7色顺序取自原4661:112973色块，未重新猜配。代表系列S1…Sn为示意映射，不是实际业务分类名，也不是图表最多只能7系列的规定。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317622","text":"使用优先级","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317623","text":"有明确图表实测或既有业务映射时，优先沿用该场景。新的一般分类比较可参考本候选色序；收费率单环、独立多环、风险灯、正负柱不机械套用这一表。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317625","text":"超过7系列或难以辨认（建议）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317626","text":"优先筛选、分面、分组查看、直接标签或精确明细；如合并“其他”需业务认可且保留组成。不要只继续添加相近颜色，也不把本表当固定系列上限。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317628","text":"与颜色总板一致","visible":true},{"id":"6695:317629","text":"颜色总板4661:109464记录角色、透明度与实测变体；本板只负责一般分类色序。原色块隐藏保留；没有修改图表业务数据或发布新的颜色Token。","visible":true}]}
